# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. Never commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-install HMAC key used to pseudonymise personal data. If this leaks, the
# pseudonyms in data/context.json become reversible by brute force.
state/pii_secret
# Local denylist of names that must be masked but are not in a structured column.
config/pii_names.local.json
.env
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client data bundle - deliberately NOT committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# drivers_roster.csv carries names, mobile numbers, driving licence numbers and
# Aadhaar numbers for 60 people. maintenance_log.xlsx and the email corpus carry
# names and a mobile number in free text. Committing any of it would push
# personal data into git history, where it cannot be deleted - which is the same
# failure the pipeline's redaction layer exists to prevent, just slower.
#
# To run: drop the candidate bundle into the repo root. See README.md.
fleet_master.csv
drivers_roster.csv
meridian_trips.csv
maintenance_log.xlsx
tickets.json
tickets_*.json
dispatcher_interview.txt
emails/
CANDIDATE_README.md
Synq_AI_*.pdf
Synq_AI_*.pptx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated at runtime. Reproduced by `node run.js all`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
outputs/
audit/
logs/
state/ledger.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
*.tmp
